WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.377 --> 00:00:02.339
(playful orchestra)

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:06.994
- Who did this?

00:00:06.994 --> 00:00:08.214
(phone ringing)

00:00:08.214 --> 00:00:09.482
- The push pin?

00:00:09.482 --> 00:00:11.352
Invented by Edwin Moore, 1900.

00:00:11.352 --> 00:00:14.136
- No, not who. (sighs)

00:00:14.136 --> 00:00:17.167
Who put their DJ flier
up next to my DJ flier?

00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:19.298
- That's Ezra's, he's the new IT guy.

00:00:19.298 --> 00:00:20.445
- Ezra?
- Yeah.

00:00:20.445 --> 00:00:21.356
- Yeah, isn't that a great name?

00:00:21.356 --> 00:00:21.870
- Amazing.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:23.229
- Ezra,
- Ezra,

00:00:23.229 --> 00:00:24.767
- Ezra.
- Ezra.

00:00:24.767 --> 00:00:25.990
(laughing)
- Aww, yeah.

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:27.036
- Yeah, it's a really cool name.

00:00:27.036 --> 00:00:28.081
- It's a great name.

00:00:28.081 --> 00:00:29.589
- Ahh, come on.

00:00:29.589 --> 00:00:30.200
- What is it?

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.993
- My computer keeps jamming up.

00:00:31.993 --> 00:00:33.471
- Oh, I'll buzz Ezra.

00:00:33.471 --> 00:00:34.536
- Oh, perfect.
- Yeah.

00:00:34.536 --> 00:00:37.930
- No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.460
I got this. It's cool.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:42.290
You don't need your
precious Ezra, you just...

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:44.505
- You made it worse!

00:00:44.505 --> 00:00:46.247
- No, it's just gonna take a second.

00:00:46.247 --> 00:00:47.037
- Harper.

00:00:47.037 --> 00:00:49.224
- It's ok, guys, guys, Ezra's coming.

00:00:49.224 --> 00:00:51.313
- Well, good, I'm glad 'cause then

00:00:51.313 --> 00:00:54.073
he gets to see me do this.

00:00:58.503 --> 00:01:00.134
- You missed terribly.

00:01:00.134 --> 00:01:03.406
(upbeat funk music)

00:01:03.406 --> 00:01:05.201
- If you guys didn't want to
go, you could've just told me.

00:01:05.201 --> 00:01:06.780
- Uh, no, man.
- Wait, no. (laughing)

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:08.069
- No, no, no, we're totally going.

00:01:08.069 --> 00:01:09.033
- We're going, we're going together.

00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:10.422
- We're stoked.
- Ezra.

00:01:10.422 --> 00:01:13.218
- Oh, hey, you must be Harper?

00:01:13.218 --> 00:01:15.067
It's nice to finally meet you.

00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:15.747
I've heard a lot --

00:01:15.747 --> 00:01:18.279
- May I speak with you privately, Ezra?

00:01:18.279 --> 00:01:19.877
- Sure, let me just uh...

00:01:21.117 --> 00:01:22.090
- What?

00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:24.170
(upbeat funk music)

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:25.058
- I'm all yours.

00:01:28.928 --> 00:01:30.758
- Look I don't know what
your playing at here,

00:01:30.758 --> 00:01:34.100
but this, this is my turf,

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.601
okay, and those guys,

00:01:37.261 --> 00:01:39.331
those are my idiots.

00:01:39.331 --> 00:01:40.270
- Look I'm sorry, I didn't --

00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:43.579
- So, if I see one more
flier for a cool thing

00:01:43.579 --> 00:01:45.901
or hear a new song that
you played for them

00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:47.808
from someone they've
never heard of before.

00:01:47.808 --> 00:01:51.731
Things are gonna get
really painful here, Ezra.

00:01:51.731 --> 00:01:54.179
- Look I just thought that
that's where people post fliers--

00:01:54.179 --> 00:01:56.085
- Some people post fliers there.

00:01:56.085 --> 00:01:57.968
- Well I'm really excited to see you play.

00:01:57.968 --> 00:01:58.999
What's your first song gonna be?

00:01:58.999 --> 00:02:00.761
- I usually start with
"Welcome to the Jungle".

00:02:00.761 --> 00:02:01.887
- Oh, that's cute.

00:02:01.887 --> 00:02:03.341
- It's ironic.

00:02:03.341 --> 00:02:04.490
- Yeah, sure, in a way.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:05.886
- No it works, it get the crowd--

00:02:05.886 --> 00:02:07.325
- Hey, I'm really sorry.

00:02:07.325 --> 00:02:09.868
I hope my enthusiasm
didn't get the best of me.

00:02:09.868 --> 00:02:11.050
It's kinda like a time I

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:14.258
stole a parking spot from Lance Butte.

00:02:14.258 --> 00:02:17.258
Oh, you know what, you probably
don't know who that is.

00:02:19.738 --> 00:02:21.986
I can see everything you type.

00:02:23.596 --> 00:02:27.264
(playful orchestra)
(phone ringing)

00:02:27.264 --> 00:02:28.471
- Oh I get it,

00:02:30.291 --> 00:02:32.311
"Welcome to the Jungle".

00:02:37.341 --> 00:02:39.117
- [Voiceover] Okay, okay, cool.

00:02:39.117 --> 00:02:40.164
(laughing)

00:02:40.164 --> 00:02:42.794
(orchestra tuning)

00:02:47.319 --> 00:02:49.056
(internet dial up)

